&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:5pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;（変動事由の概要）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;　普通株式の自己株式の株式数の増加の主な内訳は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:45pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:302.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
